                            virginis in Schonaugia cist' ord' [...] dioc'</q>. For comparison, the
                            card cites M. R. James, <title>Ancient Libraries</title>, pp. xl, 507;
                            James, <title>ALCD</title>, no. 181.</p></provenance>
